Output "out/mcp.gif"
Source theme.tape
Hide
Type `asciinema rec -q --overwrite -i 3 -c "kit tui --root $KIT_DEMO_ROOT" out/mcp.cast`
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Sleep 500ms
Type "Call tool_search for 'web search' and show me what MCP tools you found. Then use the best one to find the GitHub URL of the Runlet language, one line."
Enter
Sleep 60s
Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
